# Renders docs/media/support-demo.gif — run from repo root: vhs docs/media/support-demo.tape
Output docs/media/support-demo.gif
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1050
Set Height 620
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "# OpenAgentOS: risk-routed refunds + shadow eval of a policy change"
Enter
Type "uv run python -m apps.support.demo 2>/dev/null"
Enter
Sleep 20s
